{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 3, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「强忍可不好……」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1624", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？！呜……」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着强忍着的他，我的心中也变得燥热。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用手让他舒服起来，已经是第五次了。", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为可靠的后辈，他只有在这种时候才会向我示弱。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "作为可靠的后辈，他只有在这种时候才会向我示弱。", "plain_idx": 177, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 8, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾的前端，变得红红的……」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1625", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要这样揉弄前端，他就会发出可爱的声音。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "只要这样揉弄前端，他就会发出可爱的声音。", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的手停不下来，只为能继续听到他这种声音。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
