{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以及想要怀上他的孩子……", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以小腹才会如此难受，仅是看着他的脸就要哭出来一般。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "所以小腹才会如此难受，仅是看着他的脸就要哭出来一般。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……当然，这些我都说不出口。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
