{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*replay_miu_03", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不够有魅力，才会让他无法兴奋，完成不了初体验的。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "我不够有魅力，才会让他无法兴奋，完成不了初体验的。", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
